# SEO / GEO (gbtech.co.nz)

Full checklist: [seo-geo-instructions.md](seo-geo-instructions.md).

Priority when auditing or changing marketing pages: **0 access → 1 render/index → 2 icons/OG → 4 schema → 3 llms.txt → 5 content → 6–9 off-site/measure**.

## Hard constraints

- Demos (`/sim/`, `/sim-demos/`, `/demo/`, `/staff-demo/`) stay **Disallow** and out of sitemap — never promote as citation sources.
- Never invent `sameAs`, GBP, or social URLs; only add real profiles.
- No generic how-to blog filler — keep or add only proprietary data, first-party tools, real case studies, or distinct expert takes.
- Hand-write `/llms.txt`; do not rely on host auto-generated defaults. Treat it as a curated index, not a ranking factor.

## Checklist (verify or implement)

0. **Crawler access** — Must allow search/user bots: `OAI-SearchBot`, `ChatGPT-User`, `Claude-SearchBot`, `Claude-User`, `PerplexityBot`, `Perplexity-User`, plus `Googlebot`/`Bingbot`/`Applebot`. Training tokens (`GPTBot`, `ClaudeBot`, `Google-Extended`, `Applebot-Extended`) are a separate policy choice — blocking them does not replace allowing the search bots. Marketing paths Allow'd; demos Disallow'd. GitHub Pages + Fastly (no Cloudflare AI WAF on gbtech.co.nz — still verify any CDN/WAF on client sites).
1. **Render/index** — static HTML; HTTPS; `rel=canonical` per page; `sitemap.xml` current and linked from `robots.txt`.
2. **Icons / OG** — favicon set + absolute per-page `og:image` (see full instructions section 2).
3. **llms.txt** — brand one-liner + key indexable URLs with one-line descriptions each.
4. **JSON-LD** — LocalBusiness/Person on home; Service on service leaves; SoftwareApplication/WebApplication on tools; FAQPage/HowTo only when that content exists (static, not client-only).
5. **Content** — lead sections with standalone answers; clean H1→H2→H3; tables/lists over long prose.
6. **Client local SEO** — follow [demoplan/local-seo-entity-checklist.md](demoplan/local-seo-entity-checklist.md).
7–9. **Off-site / brand / measure** — see [demoplan/seo-entity-follow-ups.md](demoplan/seo-entity-follow-ups.md) (GBP, Search Console, AI citation spot-checks).

Full follow-ups and open domain/GBP items: [demoplan/seo-entity-follow-ups.md](demoplan/seo-entity-follow-ups.md).
